# Mobile auxiliary features

Band A/B/C template for store-distributed (or sideloaded) mobile clients.
Copy to `.devcentr/checklists/auxiliary-mobile.cmk`.
Progress: `auxiliary-mobile.cmk.checks/state.json5` (do not rewrite markers here for checkoff).

Mark N/A in the sidecar with marker `-` and a note.
Stable ids: trailing `{id="…"}`.

## Band A — 1.0 blockers

::: checklist [type="progress" id="mobile-a"]
[ ] In-app version + build {id="mobile.a.version-build"}
[ ] Store update path (+ optional Open store CTA) {id="mobile.a.store-update"}
[ ] Help / FAQ + privacy/licenses in-app {id="mobile.a.help-privacy"}
[ ] Crash reporting with consent {id="mobile.a.crash-reporting"}
[ ] Diagnostics/log export {id="mobile.a.diagnostics-export"}
[ ] Permission rationales + deny paths {id="mobile.a.permissions"}
[ ] Push consent + settings toggle (if used) {id="mobile.a.push-consent"}
[ ] Offline/sync indicators (if sync matters) {id="mobile.a.offline-sync"}
[ ] Account deletion flow (if accounts) {id="mobile.a.account-deletion"}
:::

## Band B — support and retention

::: checklist [type="progress" id="mobile-b"]
[ ] What's new on update {id="mobile.b.whats-new"}
[ ] Deep/universal links verified {id="mobile.b.deep-links"}
[ ] Backup/restore documentation {id="mobile.b.backup-restore"}
[ ] Tasteful in-app review prompts {id="mobile.b.review-prompts"}
[ ] Force-upgrade gate for breaking API {id="mobile.b.force-upgrade"}
[ ] Accessibility (dynamic type, screen readers) {id="mobile.b.a11y"}
:::

## Band C — fleets and scale

::: checklist [type="progress" id="mobile-c"]
[ ] Localization + store assets {id="mobile.c.l10n"}
[ ] MDM/managed config {id="mobile.c.mdm"}
[ ] Beta channel identity {id="mobile.c.beta-channel"}
[ ] Biometric lock if holding sensitive data {id="mobile.c.biometric"}
:::
